WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:10.280 --> 00:00:13.040
My name is Marina Abramović

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:15.440
and I'm a performance artist.

00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:33.680
The treasures shown here

00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:37.480
are so delicate and precious

00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:39.860
you can't actually touch them

00:00:39.860 --> 00:00:41.820
with your hands.

00:00:41.820 --> 00:00:44.280
You can't turn the pages.

00:00:44.280 --> 00:00:49.040
You don't have direct contact to them

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:54.210
because they are all on view behind glass.

00:00:54.210 --> 00:00:57.600
The main point for me was

00:00:57.600 --> 00:01:01.560
to give the public access to the treasures

00:01:01.560 --> 00:01:03.800
in a different way.

00:01:16.960 --> 00:01:20.060
Abramović Method is a collection

00:01:20.060 --> 00:01:22.600
of many, many exercises

00:01:22.600 --> 00:01:24.619
that I've learned for myself in

00:01:24.620 --> 00:01:27.880
order to help me to actually push

00:01:27.880 --> 00:01:30.300
my mental and physical limits.

00:01:30.300 --> 00:01:32.780
So I give the public tools

00:01:32.780 --> 00:01:35.320
to have this experience,

00:01:35.320 --> 00:01:38.160
and to see what they can do with that

00:01:38.160 --> 00:01:40.800
in their own life.

00:01:44.900 --> 00:01:47.340
Technology becomes something that

00:01:47.340 --> 00:01:49.680
retook our private time

00:01:49.680 --> 00:01:51.440
so for me it's very important

00:01:51.440 --> 00:01:54.140
essentially in this experiment, 
Abramović Method,

00:01:54.140 --> 00:01:57.600
that you leave your watch, 
and you leave your computer

00:01:57.600 --> 00:02:01.100
behind you, before you
enter the treasure place.

00:02:01.100 --> 00:02:05.340
Because that's the way, how you 
actually gain time for yourself

00:02:05.340 --> 00:02:08.200
and you gain freedom from technology.

00:02:16.100 --> 00:02:23.860
Here, you find beds and chairs 
built into the walls.

00:02:23.860 --> 00:02:26.600
You put on headphones,

00:02:26.600 --> 00:02:28.220
and use a device

00:02:28.220 --> 00:02:32.599
to actually choose the book
you want to listen to.

00:02:39.460 --> 00:02:42.000
Very secluded.

00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:44.180
Very private.

00:02:44.180 --> 00:02:47.060
Without looking at your watch,

00:02:47.060 --> 00:02:49.960
without looking at your telephone.

00:02:50.500 --> 00:02:52.620
Just you

00:02:52.620 --> 00:02:56.540
and the treasures.

